{"data":{"page":{"id":"gid://shopify/Page/167154385174","title":"Black Friday","handle":"black-friday","updatedAt":"2026-10-17T07:28:13Z","body":"<p>Black Friday runs 27–30 November.</p><p>Singles under $100 are 10% off that weekend. The discount applies at checkout with no code.</p><p>Every Japanese sealed box ships free within Australia that weekend, no minimum, no code needed.</p><p>Every Japanese box is imported from Japan by HOKO Collectables. Japanese sealed boxes are dispatched tracked from Victoria within 2–4 business days; pre-orders are dispatched tracked from Victoria once they land. Singles are dispatched within 1–3 business days.</p><p>Returns are accepted within 7 days of delivery if the item is not as described. For Christmas delivery, order Japanese sealed by Monday 7 December 2026.</p><h2>Box drop list</h2><p>Join the box drop list for $5 off a Japanese sealed box that weekend</p><form method=\"post\" action=\"/contact#bf-early-access\" id=\"bf-early-access\" accept-charset=\"UTF-8\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin:16px 0;\">\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"form_type\" value=\"customer\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"utf8\" value=\"✓\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"contact[tags]\" value=\"bf-early-access\"><label for=\"bf-early-access-email\" style=\"width:100%;\">Email</label><input type=\"email\" id=\"bf-early-access-email\" name=\"contact[email]\" required autocomplete=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@example.com\" style=\"flex:1 1 220px;padding:10px;\"><button type=\"submit\" style=\"padding:10px 18px;\">Join the list</button>\n</form><p>The $5 code is emailed to the list before 27 November. One code per order, Japanese sealed only.</p><h2>Newest Japanese boxes</h2><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(150px,1fr));gap:16px;\">\n<a href=\"/products/pokemon-30th-celebration-m6a-sealed-japanese-booster-box\" style=\"display:block;text-decoration:none;color:inherit;\"><img src=\"https